      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah, Voltergeists in the Turbines again, hmm? Standard natural hazard around these parts. Usually we just draw them into these specially made Shells.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Yeah, they're nothing fancy, just raw Storm energy encapsulated in a wooden shell and sealed with Fangle Saliva.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I'm plum out of all that though. So if you want a Ghost Shell, you need to get me the ingredients. First battle Fangles for their Saliva.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I'll also need some of that Storm Energy that shoots off the Chain. I already put out bottles to catch it. You just need to collect them.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Finally, I need the Shell of the Hookworm. It lives in a tunnel in the Fields of Blue Grass. You'll have to defeat the Earworms outside to get in.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Well, you got your tasks. Get to 'em if you want that Ghost Shell.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-AERO-NPC27_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Did you find everything? Now let me just take a look in your ear, make sure those worms didn't infect you with their catchy songs.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Dwarf_AeroCitizenF_D_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Hattie_EM2_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1447406,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
